WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:15.985
Tommy was up early the next morning.

2
00:00:15.986 --> 00:00:20.504
He did his chores quickly and then headed for the doctor's house.

3
00:00:20.505 --> 00:00:23.427
When he arrived, the house seemed empty.

4
00:00:23.428 --> 00:00:29.209
"I hope it's not too early," Tommy said to himself.

5
00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:35.016
"Hello? Dr. Dolittle?" Tommy called out, but there was no reply.

6
00:00:35.017 --> 00:00:37.993
Tommy took a few more steps inside.

7
00:00:37.994 --> 00:00:42.010
Suddenly he heard a low, growling noise.

8
00:00:42.011 --> 00:00:47.304
Tommy was about to turn around and leave when he heard a familiar voice.

9
00:00:47.305 --> 00:00:50.629
"Jip! Stop that! You know Tommy!"

10
00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:56.694
Dr. Dolittle came running out, wearing a funny pair of glasses and rubber gloves.

11
00:00:56.695 --> 00:01:00.896
"Good morning, Tommy!" The doctor smiled.

12
00:01:00.897 --> 00:01:05.290
"I was trying to speak with the wiff-waff," said the doctor.

13
00:01:05.291 --> 00:01:08.738
"Have you made progress?" Tommy asked politely.

14
00:01:08.739 --> 00:01:12.083
"No, not really," sighed the doctor.

15
00:01:12.084 --> 00:01:14.084
Tommy patted Jip.

16
00:01:14.085 --> 00:01:17.534
"Where are Polynesia and the others?" he asked.

17
00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:20.074
"Out in the garden for their morning walk."

18
00:01:20.075 --> 00:01:23.552
Dr. Dolittle removed his funny glasses.

19
00:01:23.553 --> 00:01:26.037
"Would you like to see my garden?"

20
00:01:26.038 --> 00:01:28.298
Tommy did indeed.

21
00:01:28.299 --> 00:01:31.857
Dr. Dolittle led Tommy through a thick forest.

22
00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:37.444
He heard all kinds of animal sounds but could not see anything except trees.

23
00:01:37.445 --> 00:01:41.028
Then suddenly, Tommy stopped in his tracks.

24
00:01:41.029 --> 00:01:44.220
The forest opened into a large field.

25
00:01:44.221 --> 00:01:52.045
The field was full of all sorts of flowers, animals, birds, and insects.

26
00:01:52.046 --> 00:01:56.138
It was the most beautiful sight Tommy had ever seen.

27
00:01:56.139 --> 00:01:59.618
Tommy spotted Gub-Gub rolling around in mud.

28
00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:03.251
He saw Dab-Dab diving in and out of a pond.

29
00:02:03.252 --> 00:02:10.712
And sitting on a large tree branch, Polynesia was chatting to another colorful bird.

30
00:02:10.713 --> 00:02:13.576
Suddenly Tommy let out a scream.

31
00:02:13.577 --> 00:02:20.051
A large black snake was sliding over his foot. He jumped.

32
00:02:20.052 --> 00:02:25.716
"Well, I told him to move his foot, didn't I?" hissed the reptile.

33
00:02:25.717 --> 00:02:32.917
"That's Stanley. Don't worry, he's harmless," Dr. Dolittle said, smiling.

34
00:02:32.918 --> 00:02:36.756
"Do you have any lions or tigers?" asked Tommy.

35
00:02:36.757 --> 00:02:42.618
"I'd like to, but they would eat up all the other animals," the doctor said sadly.

36
00:02:42.619 --> 00:02:47.019
"Oh, you have a deer!" Tommy pointed excitedly.

37
00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.268
"No, that's not a deer," the doctor said.

38
00:02:52.269 --> 00:02:54.820
Tommy could not believe his eyes!

39
00:02:54.821 --> 00:02:57.335
The creature had two heads.

40
00:02:57.336 --> 00:03:00.792
"Look at him staring," said one head.

41
00:03:00.793 --> 00:03:04.083
"How rude!" remarked the other head.

42
00:03:04.084 --> 00:03:09.943
"It's his first time seeing you, that's all," the doctor said kindly.

43
00:03:09.944 --> 00:03:13.500
"Come here, Tommy," the doctor called out.

44
00:03:13.501 --> 00:03:16.614
"This is the rarest animal in the world.

45
00:03:16.615 --> 00:03:19.884
It's the pushmi-pullyu, from Africa."

46
00:03:19.885 --> 00:03:23.509
Tommy walked over to it nervously.

47
00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:27.127
"Can I get back to my breakfast, Doctor?" said the pushmi head.

48
00:03:27.128 --> 00:03:28.876
"I'm so hungry."

49
00:03:28.877 --> 00:03:31.596
Tommy gently touched the creature.

50
00:03:31.597 --> 00:03:36.708
"Well, at least he doesn't scratch," said the pullyu head.

51
00:03:36.709 --> 00:03:38.659
Tommy was amazed.

52
00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:42.498
"It's a wonderful garden, Doctor," he said.

53
00:03:42.499 --> 00:03:46.169
"But it's a lot of work." The doctor sighed.

54
00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:49.457
"I could use some help to look after all the animals."

55
00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:51.309
Tommy's heart leaped.

56
00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:55.311
"I could help you, Dr. Dolittle," he said excitedly.

57
00:03:55.312 --> 00:04:01.243
"Yes, I do need an assistant," the doctor replied thoughtfully.

58
00:04:01.244 --> 00:04:06.266
"I'm a hard worker and I do love animals," Tommy said eagerly.

59
00:04:06.267 --> 00:04:08.626
The doctor rubbed his chin.

60
00:04:08.627 --> 00:04:12.970
"I think it's a great idea," Polynesia said.

61
00:04:12.971 --> 00:04:15.977
Tommy looked at the doctor hopefully.

62
00:04:15.978 --> 00:04:17.302
"All right, Tommy.

63
00:04:17.303 --> 00:04:22.497
If your parents agree, you can be my assistant," smiled the doctor.

64
00:04:22.498 --> 00:04:31.204
Tommy let out such a loud shout of joy that all the animals stopped and stared.

65
00:04:31.205 --> 00:04:36.234
"Humans are so strange," remarked the pushmi-pullyu to itself.

66
00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:43.602
"And they say we're loud!" quacked Dab-Dab.
